# Data scripts and migrations are applied to D1 with `wrangler d1 execute --file`.
# A CRLF checkout changes the bytes that reach the database: the three classes
# imported in #92 landed in production with 
 inside their stored markdown
# because git rewrote the scripts on the post-merge checkout. Pin LF so the
# applied file is always byte-identical to the reviewed one.
*.sql text eol=lf
